---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import AppGrid from '../components/AppGrid.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Apps for Change: Free Well-Being Apps, No Strings Attached" description="Free apps to help you reach goals, show kindness, ride out cravings, and speak up for yourself. No ads. No paywalls. We never sell your data.">
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="home-hero shell">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">A Minnesota nonprofit · Coming 2027</p>
      <h1>Free apps to help you live your best life. No strings attached.</h1>
      <p class="lead">We're building four free apps to help you reach your goals, show up for the people you love, ride out cravings, and speak up for yourself. No ads. No paywalls. We never sell your data.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:info@appsforchange.org?subject=Launch%20updates">Get launch updates</a><a class="button secondary" href="/donate">Support our mission</a></div></div>
      <img src="/images/afc-logo.png" alt="Apps for Change logo" width="400" height="400" />
    </section>
    <div class="promise-strip"><ul class="shell"><li>Free forever</li><li>No ads, ever</li><li>We never sell your data</li><li>Shaped by our community</li></ul></div>
    <div class="shell"><AppGrid /></div>
    <section class="difference"><div class="shell"><h2>Built for people, not profit.</h2><div class="three-columns">
      <article><h3>Free means free.</h3><p>No subscriptions, no in-app purchases, no premium version. Every feature is free, including crisis resources.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Your data stays yours.</h3><p>We never sell your information or use it for ads. Our team doesn't read your entries, and you can delete everything anytime.</p><a href="/your-data">How we protect your data →</a></article>
      <article><h3>You help decide what we build.</h3><p>Starting in early 2027, quarterly town halls let you preview new features and share ideas. Our bylaws require that what we hear goes to our Board.</p><a href="/town-halls">About town halls →</a></article>
    </div></div></section>
    <figure class="founder-quote shell"><blockquote>“I started Apps for Change because it was the most realistic way for me to make a difference in my community. I want people to have a free app that can help them improve their life, no strings attached.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Sam, Founder and Executive Director</figcaption></figure>
    <section class="town-teaser shell"><h2>Have a say in what we build.</h2><p>Our free quarterly virtual town halls start in early 2027. See what's coming, share your ideas, and talk with the people building the apps. No tech experience needed.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:sam@appsforchange.org?subject=Town%20Hall">Save my spot</a></section>
  </main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  function redirectDonation() {
    if (window.location.hash === '#donate') window.location.replace('/donate');
  }
  redirectDonation();
  window.addEventListener('hashchange', redirectDonation);
</script>
